~ start
Az: Hello? Can you hear me?
Fenn: Az? Where are you?
Az: Let's GO!! It works! [i]cough[/i]
Fenn: The bangle?
Az: Yeah! I've got the other one with me. You can talk to someone through them
Az: Just- [wait=0.2]don't tell [color="red"]Post Master Parker[/color].[wait=0.2] He'd freak out and call it sacrilege or something.
Fenn: You [i]made[/i] these? [font_size=60]That's [shake level=10 rate=30]AWESOME.[/shake][/font_size]
Az: You think? [wait=0.2]Hah, thanks. [wait=0.2]It's really not much.
Az: Anyways, don't let me stop you. [i]cough[/i].
Fenn: You cough a lot. [wait=0.2]Are you okay?
Az: Uh. [wait=0.2]Yeah, no, [wait=0.2]I'm fine.[wait=0.2] Just something caught in my throat.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-BangleTalk-CellarGeneral", true)
